  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO/LRC - Support to DM and DRR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We submitted a concept note to FCDO to support the DM and the DRR in LRC. The project will be 3 years project, 1 Million GBP/year covering 3 Thematic Areas:
DM (disaster Management) and CVAP (Cash and voucher assistance preparedness):


Strengthen LRC&#x2019;s institutional capacity for CVA.
Equip 21 DM centers with vehicles, IT, communication, and safety gear as per the DM Minimum Standards&#xa0;
Train staff/volunteers.


Locally Led DRR (disaster risk reduction):


Implement Road to Community Resilience Framework in high-risk communities over 3 years.
Establish Resilience Committees and Community Emergency Response Teams (CERTs).
Project will be crosscutting in climate risk analysis, early warning systems, and has school safety programs.


Urban Search and Rescue: supporting two LRC stations per year with training and equipment
Crisis Modifier: Flexible mechanism for rapid response to conflict or climate shocks (e.g., cash assistance, ..)</narrative>
  </description>
